  videoWalkthroughUrl: https://unitycodemonkey.teachable.com/courses/problem-solving/lectures/63459343
  exerciseText: 'System with Keys and matching Doors that are opened with that same
    Key.


    In this Scenario the Player can move around, touch Keys to pick them
    up which adds them to the Inventory. Then by approaching a Door the player can
    use the Key of the same color to open it.


    <b>NOTE: Completing this Exercise
    will DELETE all the files, so if you want to keep your own personal implementation
    of this System then make a BACKUP before clicking on Complete Exercise!</b>'
